    "name": "AppDynamics Controller REST Tiers API",
    "description": "The AppDynamics Controller REST API provides programmatic access to the AppDynamics Controller for retrieving application performance data, managing configurations, and automating monitoring workflows. The API uses standard HTTP methods and returns data in XML or JSON format, with the base URI pattern of /controller/rest/. Developers can use it to query application metrics, retrieve transaction snapshots, manage business transactions, and access topology information for monitored applications.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Splunk AppDynamics Support",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
